s":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-08T17:17:44-07:00","id":433306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/432369-what-do-you-picture-the-new-dawn-to-be-like-in-2e?p=433008#post433008\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I kind of pictured the New Dawn looking the the Doctor's regeneration on Doctor Who, and I don't see a reason why it would be different now.</div> </div> </div> </div>Call me sappy...or stupid...but I always kind of pictured something like the end of Disney's &quot;Beauty and the Beast&quot;--Light ignites the promethean from the inside out as pyros flows, transforming it into a true human. Following that, something like a reverse-wasteland effect takes place as all around the promethean the land and people heal and become invigorated due to the mass flow of pyros.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T12:23:21-07:00","id":434396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hellovg</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/432369-what-do-you-picture-the-new-dawn-to-be-like-in-2e?p=433306#post433306\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Call me sappy...or stupid...but I always kind of pictured something like the end of Disney's &quot;Beauty and the Beast&quot;--Light ignites the promethean from the inside out as pyros flows, transforming it into a true human. Following that, something like a reverse-wasteland effect takes place as all around the promethean the land and people heal and become invigorated due to the mass flow of pyros.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> While a big, dramatic orchestral refrain from &quot;Tale as Old as Time&quot; plays in the background?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://eoinsstuff.shoutwiki.com/wiki/Genius:_the_Transgression_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Genius: the Transgression 2E is a thing that's being worked on.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4488-malonkey1","name":"malonkey1","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4488_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1620"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T17:02:00-07:00","id":434864,"title":"","content":"I prefer it a bit more quiet and introspective. Suddenly, the character feels different somehow. Strangely content. No, there is no flashy pyrotechnics and blazes of light. Just a feeling of things being all right now. And then, after a moment of trying to figure out what has happened to you, why you suddenly perceive things differently, why nothing seems to be the same anymore, you realise, yep, you did. You made it. Congratulations!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Politeness is the lubricant of social intercourse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/272-saibot","name":"saibot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar272_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1063"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-09T23:23:55-07:00","id":435359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>malonkey1</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/432369-what-do-you-picture-the-new-dawn-to-be-like-in-2e?p=434396#post434396\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> While a big, dramatic orchestral refrain from &quot;Tale as Old as Time&quot; plays in the background?</div> </div> </div> </div>Ha, ha!<br /> <br /> Well, not quite that saccharine...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1868-hellovg","name":"hellovg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"165"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-13T10:30:45-07:00","id":440116,"title":"","content":"I liked how Bran went through his New Dawn in the anthology... He was struck with electricity in making the new Frankenstein, Sunny... Coming away from the thunderstrike he was a normal crow. Though perhaps the New Dawn could be different for each Promethean depending on what their Lineage is and what Refinement got them to there.<br /> An Ulgan may be pulled apart by spirits and reconstructed into a living human, a Tammuz may have their old appearance drop from them in lumps of clay to have their new dawn self be unveiled underneath... Stuff like that.<br /> It struck me that when the New Dawn comes, the Promethean won't remember their time as one of the Created. Though perhaps their time as a Created may influence just how they'll be as a new person.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3951-wander","name":"wander","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"409"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}